          "操作系统随项目积累工程知识"
        ],
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-342783e341e84ea5",
            "quote": "The startup, which operates as an engineering firm of record rather than a software vendor, aims to automate mechanical, electrical, and plumbing (MEP) design processes using proprietary AI agents.",
            "source_content_hash": "8683c5c58c982aba",
            "quote_hash": "f4dbd6758d2a2a631af0b56d565623bdf56d8be2228378b7eaa54a6fa12af5d0"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-ccd8e12baa5374e7",
            "quote": "Rather than sell software licences or bill consulting hours, Solvera acts as the engineering firm of record. It provides end-to-end services — from initial requirements through to construction-ready designs — using purpose-built AI agents to automate a growing share of the work while human engineers handle judgement.",
            "source_content_hash": "355c348d7b190131",
            "quote_hash": "a1ba05115953c5dc55249ff9cfb89ad79f9902c7871b73a760dd39ceab8691a9"
          }
        ],
